WEBVTT

00:07:57.932 --> 00:08:00.976
So don't ask "Will this
make me sound funny?"

00:08:00.976 --> 00:08:04.980
Instead, ask: “How will this make
other people feel?”

00:08:05.272 --> 00:08:07.274
NB: Which also means never punching down,

00:08:07.316 --> 00:08:10.027
that is, making fun
of someone of lower status.

00:08:10.069 --> 00:08:11.862
And be sure to check your distance.

00:08:11.904 --> 00:08:14.782
How close are you personally
to what you're making light of?

00:08:14.823 --> 00:08:18.244
I can make fun of my mother,
but not your mother,

00:08:18.285 --> 00:08:21.747
who, by the way,
I hear is a saint, a lovely lady.

00:08:21.789 --> 00:08:22.957
JA: An angel.

00:08:23.707 --> 00:08:27.962
NB: Our hope today is that you start
climbing back up the humor cliff.

00:08:28.003 --> 00:08:30.714
Start with what's true, and start small.